 "description": "Saves finished artwork on a skateboard deck and returns a browser link for 3D preview, editing and ordering, plus a picture of the deck assembled with trucks and wheels. Takes exactly one of image_base64 or composition. Stores an unlisted design; it generates no AI artwork and places no order. Each successful call creates a new design.",
